Description:

The ``VENDOR.CMU-DAV`` LIST selection option now only lists DAV mailboxes
(``#calendars``, ``#addressbooks`` and the like) for admins and sessions
logged in with the ``+dav`` suffix, as every other command that touches
them already required.


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that list DAV mailboxes with ``VENDOR.CMU-DAV`` must log in as
``user+dav`` or as an admin.


